      "purpose": "`settings` is a typed runtime-settings library for values that operators, tenants, users, and resources change while an application is running. It provides explicit precedence, immutable snapshots, optimistic writes, audit history, schema evolution, PostgreSQL persistence, and optional Valkey caching.",
